  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Step into heritage-inspired style and modern comfort with the ASICS GEL-NYC 2.0. Blending early-2000s running DNA with updated lifestyle-ready tooling, these shoes keep your stride smooth, cushioned, and effortlessly cool from sunup to sundown. The upper nods to the iconic GEL-1050 silhouette, refreshed with premium suede overlays for a sleek, elevated finish. Underfoot, a redesigned midsole packed with GEL inserts, TRUSSTIC support, and FF BLAST PLUS cushioning delivers a lighter, bouncier ride than the original—perfect for all-day wear. From city commutes to weekend wanderings, the Asics GEL-NYC 2.0 brings style, stability, and cloud-level comfort to every step.</p> <p><strong>Asics GEL-NYC 2.0 features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Mesh and suede upper offers comfort and everyday wearability.</li> <li>Suede overlays add premium texture and elevate the heritage-inspired look.</li> <li>Rearfoot and forefoot GEL Technology increases impact absorption and boosts comfort.</li> <li>FF BLAST PLUS cushioning delivers lightweight bounce and a plush underfoot feel.</li> <li>EVA midsole component provides supportive cushioning and improves step-in softness.</li> <li>TPU TRUSSTIC technology improves midfoot stability and reduces overall midsole weight.</li> <li>GUIDANCE LINE technology supports efficient stride mechanics and promotes smoother motion.</li> <li>Angled heel softens heel impact and encourages a natural forward roll.</li> <li>Walking-specific flex grooves increase flexibility and enable smoother stride transitions.</li> <li>Rubber outsole provides durable traction and enhances grip across various surfaces.</li> </ul></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS®</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS® GEL-NYC 2.0 - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Gray/Navy</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>1203A895-300</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">ASICS® Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Men's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official ASICS® shoe size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 8</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 7</td><td style='padding:6px 12px